ould  countenance that would jibe with that  so  this is where we'll leave off and in the  next video we'll take up  right where we're leading off with this  this ethics of quantity of experience  and look at  the different types that he  distinguishes and then talk about  creation and then finally we'll get to  the myth of synthesis itself
 

